# Primary key fingerprints allowed to sign the pinned Debian 13 snapshot's
# InRelease files. One per line, 40 uppercase hex digits, then the owner.
# The .asc files next to this one carry the key material, exported from
# debian-archive-keyring 2025.1. Each fingerprint was checked against
# https://ftp-master.debian.org/keys.html. Adding a key is its own reviewed
# pull request.
