5E04A1E3223A19A20706E20F9904613D4CCE68C6 Debian Security Archive Automatic Signing Key (13/trixie)
41587F7DB8C774BCCF131416762F67A0B2C39DE4 Debian Stable Release Key (13/trixie)
# The 13/trixie Release files are also signed by the 12/bookworm archive keys.
# gpgv stops at a signature whose key it does not have, so these are pinned
# too; a Release file needs at least one valid signature from this list.
